{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0fd998791d676276","name":"Halt","source":{"id":"source:reference-0fd998791d676276","title":"Halt","revision":21337,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:36:44Z","sha256":"4500df5e55ea245de4ce4de793d1bb106ed3bd8b148e518da828649b1d39c96a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21337","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Halt&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0fd998791d676276","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},", you can stop an enemy in its tracks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +8, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," (Chosen Weapon)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," If you hit with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},", while wielding a weapon for which you possess the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," feat, against an enemy of up to one size larger than you, compare the same die roll against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check. If the die roll succeeds against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check, the target immediately halts all movement and falls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," in its current square. The target can spend any remaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," normally.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If your attack exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the target loses any remaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," and ends its turn immediately. Apply damage normally to the target regardless of the results of this feat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If the target is using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," Action when moving past you, its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," is ended if you successfully knock it ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},", and the target cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," again on this turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
